<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-DCC yr pretax profit up 22.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-DCC yr pretax profit up 22.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		33.10	     vs 25.36</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.96		vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.00		vs 6.90</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    35.27	     vs 28.86</p>
<p> Turnover		   627.66	    vs 535.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Ireland-based industrial holding group is DCC Plc. The company said all of its divisions were &quot;budgeting for growth&quot; in the current year and that it was confident for the future.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
